{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"alias":"tardy-obsolete-newt","creation_channel":"cli","description":"Introduce a reduced-depth review tier for low-complexity plans (plan review) and small/mechanical changes (code review), with a classifier or heuristic gate deciding tier and a conservative fallback to full review. Acceptance: tier decision logged per review; gold-set check that lite tier does not miss blocking findings on low-complexity work; unit-cost reduction measured.","id":"9bb8-965f-0781-48f4","parent_id":"887c-009e-bc96-48c8","priority":2,"tags":["cost"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Add lite review tiers for low-complexity plans and changes"},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1789406150166825001,"uuid":"90905cfd-a793-4218-99d7-bc97725da603"}